        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tube insulation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tube insulation plant
Infrastructure for factory including landuse not including machinery. Annual production 5000 tonnes tube insulation material. Transformation based on general assumption with a lifetime of 50a.;
UUID: c0851291-6357-3fd9-b831-3ab789f006ed
Infrastructure for two producers with production places in Münster and Zeulenroda, Germany and in Thailand.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production plant for elastomere tube insulations.
Time period: Year of environmental reporting. Two different production places.
Production volume: 20000t
Sampling: Environmental report and questionnaire. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c0851291-6357-3fd9-b831-3ab789f006ed.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
